{"cast":"unclejune","group":"three","bank":"three.40a81e6021.bin","lines":[{"id":"three.intro.01","moment":"three.intro","text":"Welcome to Downtown, Blossom Park style. Six shooters, five racks, sixty seconds. Mind the money balls. Top three move on.","off":0,"len":33101,"sec":7.178},{"id":"three.intro.02","moment":"three.intro","text":"Shooting contest. Set shots in my day, but go on. Five racks, sixty seconds, six shooters. Top three advance.","off":33101,"len":30438,"sec":6.575},{"id":"three.intro.03","moment":"three.intro","text":"Now, this one's for the patient ones. Five racks, the money balls, sixty seconds. Six shoot, three advance.","off":63539,"len":28535,"sec":5.794},{"id":"three.go.01","moment":"three.go","text":"Take your time. Quickly.","off":92074,"len":11589,"sec":1.691},{"id":"three.go.02","moment":"three.go","text":"Go on, then!","off":103663,"len":8845,"sec":1.066},{"id":"three.go.03","moment":"three.go","text":"Let it fly!","off":112508,"len":8714,"sec":0.95},{"id":"three.rack.01","moment":"three.rack","text":"Next rack, please.","off":121222,"len":10714,"sec":1.401},{"id":"three.rack.02","moment":"three.rack","text":"Move along now.","off":131936,"len":9802,"sec":1.205},{"id":"three.rack.03","moment":"three.rack","text":"Keep strolling.","off":141738,"len":8706,"sec":1.06},{"id":"three.rack.04","moment":"three.rack","text":"Onward, youngster.","off":150444,"len":9957,"sec":1.294},{"id":"three.lastrack.01","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Last rack. Finish your plate.","off":160401,"len":11387,"sec":1.597},{"id":"three.lastrack.02","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Final rack, youngster. Empty it.","off":171788,"len":12979,"sec":1.943},{"id":"three.lastrack.03","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"One more rack. Make it sweet.","off":184767,"len":12506,"sec":1.811},{"id":"three.money.01","moment":"three.money","text":"Money ball. Counts double.","off":197273,"len":11733,"sec":1.699},{"id":"three.money.02","moment":"three.money","text":"Here's the good one.","off":209006,"len":9863,"sec":1.305},{"id":"three.money.03","moment":"three.money","text":"Worth two, youngster.","off":218869,"len":10748,"sec":1.415},{"id":"three.money.04","moment":"three.money","text":"This one pays.","off":229617,"len":9306,"sec":1.108},{"id":"three.make.01","moment":"three.make","text":"There it is.","off":238923,"len":8093,"sec":0.895},{"id":"three.make.02","moment":"three.make","text":"Good.","off":247016,"len":6962,"sec":0.625},{"id":"three.make.03","moment":"three.make","text":"Sweet.","off":253978,"len":7785,"sec":0.719},{"id":"three.make.04","moment":"three.make","text":"Counts.","off":261763,"len":7191,"sec":0.69},{"id":"three.make.05","moment":"three.make","text":"Pretty.","off":268954,"len":7247,"sec":0.718},{"id":"three.make.06","moment":"three.make","text":"That'll do.","off":276201,"len":8347,"sec":0.851},{"id":"three.make.money.01","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Money ball, cashed.","off":284548,"len":10599,"sec":1.435},{"id":"three.make.money.02","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Double, and deserved.","off":295147,"len":10633,"sec":1.399},{"id":"three.make.money.03","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Ooh, that pays nicely.","off":305780,"len":11165,"sec":1.518},{"id":"three.make.money.04","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Ring the bell, Rollie!","off":316945,"len":10723,"sec":1.482},{"id":"three.miss.01","moment":"three.miss","text":"Pity.","off":327668,"len":6969,"sec":0.656},{"id":"three.miss.02","moment":"three.miss","text":"Didn't drop.","off":334637,"len":8215,"sec":0.904},{"id":"three.miss.03","moment":"three.miss","text":"Next one.","off":342852,"len":8648,"sec":0.895},{"id":"three.miss.04","moment":"three.miss","text":"Almost.","off":351500,"len":8035,"sec":0.83},{"id":"three.miss.05","moment":"three.miss","text":"Nearly.","off":359535,"len":7333,"sec":0.681},{"id":"three.streak.01","moment":"three.streak","text":"Like clockwork, folks.","off":366868,"len":11173,"sec":1.548},{"id":"three.streak.02","moment":"three.streak","text":"Now we're cooking.","off":378041,"len":9463,"sec":1.157},{"id":"three.streak.03","moment":"three.streak","text":"One after another.","off":387504,"len":10305,"sec":1.328},{"id":"three.streak.04","moment":"three.streak","text":"Oh, the bench likes this.","off":397809,"len":11219,"sec":1.609},{"id":"three.fire.01","moment":"three.fire","text":"My word. Can't miss, can it?","off":409028,"len":11950,"sec":1.765},{"id":"three.fire.02","moment":"three.fire","text":"Somebody tell the old-timers!","off":420978,"len":12616,"sec":1.913},{"id":"three.fire.03","moment":"three.fire","text":"Whole rack! Not a crumb left!","off":433594,"len":11761,"sec":1.784},{"id":"three.fire.04","moment":"three.fire","text":"Pure spring water, every one!","off":445355,"len":12609,"sec":1.906},{"id":"three.cold.01","moment":"three.cold","text":"Late frost. It'll pass.","off":457964,"len":11377,"sec":1.623},{"id":"three.cold.02","moment":"three.cold","text":"Patience. The rim remembers you.","off":469341,"len":13098,"sec":1.972},{"id":"three.cold.03","moment":"three.cold","text":"Slow down, sprout. Old-timer pace.","off":482439,"len":15009,"sec":2.468},{"id":"three.clock.01","moment":"three.clock","text":"Ten seconds, youngster!","off":497448,"len":11761,"sec":1.615},{"id":"three.clock.02","moment":"three.clock","text":"Step lively, ten seconds!","off":509209,"len":12530,"sec":1.857},{"id":"three.clock.03","moment":"three.clock","text":"Last ten, now hurry!","off":521739,"len":11188,"sec":1.596},{"id":"three.buzzer.01","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Horn went, ball still counts!","off":532927,"len":12713,"sec":1.941},{"id":"three.buzzer.02","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Out before the horn. Counts!","off":545640,"len":11808,"sec":1.75},{"id":"three.buzzer.03","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Beat the buzzer! Count it!","off":557448,"len":11067,"sec":1.459},{"id":"three.results.01","moment":"three.results","text":"Here come the numbers. Shooter by shooter, now.","off":568515,"len":14417,"sec":2.385},{"id":"three.results.02","moment":"three.results","text":"Let's see the board. Patience, folks, one at a time.","off":582932,"len":16260,"sec":2.915},{"id":"three.advance.01","moment":"three.advance","text":"You're moving on, sprout. The final's waiting, and the bench is too.","off":599192,"len":18725,"sec":3.523},{"id":"three.advance.02","moment":"three.advance","text":"Through to the final! Blossom Park's got a shooter.","off":617917,"len":15403,"sec":2.637},{"id":"three.advance.03","moment":"three.advance","text":"Advancing. Don't celebrate yet, youngster. Save some for the final.","off":633320,"len":19479,"sec":3.609},{"id":"three.out.01","moment":"three.out","text":"Out in qualifying. That's all right. The rim will be here tomorrow.","off":652799,"len":19154,"sec":3.54},{"id":"three.out.02","moment":"three.out","text":"Not this time, sprout. Shoot a few hundred and come see me.","off":671953,"len":17334,"sec":3.037},{"id":"three.out.03","moment":"three.out","text":"Didn't make the cut. Back in my day, neither did I. Twice.","off":689287,"len":17724,"sec":3.096},{"id":"three.final.01","moment":"three.final","text":"The final, youngster. You've seen the number. Now go past it, nice and easy.","off":707011,"len":21394,"sec":4.036},{"id":"three.final.02","moment":"three.final","text":"Shooting last, number known. My old coach called that a gift.","off":728405,"len":18118,"sec":3.163},{"id":"three.final.03","moment":"three.final","text":"Final round. The others are done. Now it's you. Beat the number, sprout.","off":746523,"len":19370,"sec":3.582},{"id":"three.clinch.01","moment":"three.clinch","text":"That's the number! It's yours!","off":765893,"len":11894,"sec":1.758},{"id":"three.clinch.02","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Well, now. That'll win it.","off":777787,"len":11182,"sec":1.54},{"id":"three.clinch.03","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Past the number! Go on, smile!","off":788969,"len":12598,"sec":1.873},{"id":"three.champion.01","moment":"three.champion","text":"Three-point champion of Blossom Park! Put that name up by the fountain.","off":801567,"len":20663,"sec":3.848},{"id":"three.champion.02","moment":"three.champion","text":"Champion! Back in my day, the prize was a free cone. Today, too. Rollie?","off":822230,"len":20788,"sec":4.012},{"id":"three.champion.03","moment":"three.champion","text":"The best shooter in Blossom Park. Hollis wants a rematch, set shot only.","off":843018,"len":22683,"sec":4.322}]}